n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately; provided however that the amend-\nments to section 7 of chapter 425 of the Laws of 2012 relating to incor-\nporating the Main-Transit Volunteer Exempt Firefighter's Benevolent\nAssociation made by section one of this act shall apply to taxes due on\npremiums received on and after January 1, 2022.\n",
